that the game is good. But afterwards, Bland gameplay and none interesting storyline also enemies spawning out of thin air, dialogues are irrelevant. Seems like it was made by indie developers, EA is good at butchering their games I feel like half the of the production team behind this didn't do their job while the other half did what they are supposed too lol. 6.5/10 would have given it a 7 if enemies didn't spawn out of thin air right in front of you and an 8 if there wasn't face animation issues.", "timestamp_created": 1782799567, "timestamp_updated": 1783047623, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229192970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198253763557", "personaname": "agent_1667", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198253763557/", "num_games_owned": 158, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 672, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 672, "last_played": 1706323326, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "If this wasn't a mass effect game it would be fine, but every time I do a quest I am reminded how much weaker the writing is than the other 3 games.", "timestamp_created": 1782772805, "timestamp_updated": 1782772805, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.616603851318359375", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229114643", "author": {"steamid": "76561198422910738", "personaname": "Yo Boy Bob", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198422910738/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1577, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 762, "last_played": 1788116057, "avatar": "0a4aa24f07c313214697e6d72f33959ed9cebdcf"}, "language": "english", "review": "I just bought this on my PC since console runs at 5 frames per second but i've played the story on multiple different playthroughs. This was my first mass effect game which after my first run, sent me to the original trilogy where i see why the OG fans criticize this game so much. However i do love this game lots. Jumping into another galaxy trying to make worlds livable, the research and crafting system, and the feeling of exploring unknowns all in a mass effect tone makes it worth it to me. i still prefer mass effect 2 but comes second for me in the franchise lineup. (The remnant was 10/10 and i hope they show up in mass effect 5)", "timestamp_created": 1782697290, "timestamp_updated": 1782697290, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534161508083343506", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "hardware": {"system_ram": "64617", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER", "vram_size": 16045}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229107116", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058635054", "personaname": "itmejlee", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/itmejlee/", "num_games_owned": 2935, "num_reviews": 428, "playtime_forever": 3822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3822, "last_played": 1782688011, "avatar": "7ae537b6b7b7b09e68f52e76cdb8f0727f5cb270"}, "language": "english", "review": "Laughably effeminate galaxy. Boring nonsensical plot, forgett